#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:148
msgid ""
"and look at the \"Current Development\" links (at the moment, the "
"<b>Sysv</b> book is listed"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:149
