msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><h4>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:153
msgid "<a name=\"fonttable\"/>The table of fonts"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:155
msgid ""
"When I first revised this in 2011 I put all the fonts in one table, "
"and the numbers are"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:156
msgid ""
"referenced in various Lipsum and similar files. In 2018 I added a lot "
"more fonts, and"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:157
msgid ""
"put them in a second table to save renumbering things. Both those "
"tables are mostly"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:158
msgid ""
"in alphabetical order by the fontconfig names. More recently I have "
"found other fonts,"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:159
msgid ""
"and added them to a third table as I came across them. I have now "
"merged all three"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:160
msgid ""
"tables into one while trying to update to current HTML and CSS "
"standards. To help"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:161
msgid ""
"finding a font in this table I have now added indexes, both for the "
"names used in"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:162
msgid ""
"fontconfig, and for my (one-word or hyphenated) identifiers used in "
"the filenames."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:165
msgid "<a href=\"idx1.html\">Index of fonts by Fontconfig name</a>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:166
msgid "<a href=\"idx2.html\">Index of fonts by my Identifier</a>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:168
msgid "Most of the columns are, I hope, self-explanatory."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:169
msgid ""
"The 'Revised' column links to a XeLaTeX or LuaLaTeX source file with "
"the date when"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:170
msgid ""
"I revised the 'languages' PDF (before 2025-01-26 XeLaTeX, then "
"LuaLaTeX). It also"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:171
msgid ""
"links to my small caps sc.tex files where those exist. Many of my "
"files revised before"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:172
msgid "2024 exaggerate which codepoints or languages are available.)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:173
msgid ""
"The 'Languages' links are to PDFs showing which of my example "
"languages are"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:174
msgid ""
"supported, and also to files of SC (Small Caps) support where the "
"font has those."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:175
msgid ""
"<i>The PDFs revised since 2025-01-26 use the full page so many not be "
"printable.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:176
msgid ""
"The Bold column indicates that at least one darker weight also exists."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:177
msgid ""
"The Italic column indicates an Italic <b>or</b> a Slant style exists."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:178
msgid ""
"The Package column provides links to where to download a (perhaps "
"later) version"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:179
msgid ""
"of the font: Many fonts lack version numbers: for those I note the "
"fontfile date or"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:180
msgid "commit date if downloaded from a git site."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><p><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/typosetting.html:181
msgid "Codepoints links to plain text files of what is in the font."
